# Optional dev convenience. Nothing here is configuration any more: since v0.4
# the app asks for its CalDAV server on first run and keeps the address and
# login in the device keystore (Android) or derives them from the page's own
# origin (web). See docs/Deploy.md.
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_DAV_URL is Metro-inlined at build time and is used for exactly one
# thing: prefilling the address field on the setup screen, so a fresh
# `android:dev` install does not need retyping. Leaving it unset changes
# nothing except that you type the address once.
EXPO_PUBLIC_DAV_URL=
